        "!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!",
        "!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!###!!!%%%%%%%%%%$$TTTTT",
        "TTTT$%,*,*,*,*,*,*,*,*////////////////////////////////////////////////|~0~!~!~!||~0~!~!~!|qOOOqO",
        "OOqOOOqOOOqOOOqOOOqOOOqOOOD2%$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$",
